{"assignees":[{"id":"U_kgDODAB_0g","login":"k1shna","name":"Krishna","databaseId":201359314}],"author":{"id":"U_kgDODXcjjQ","is_bot":false,"login":"tvardhineniTT","name":"Teja Priya Vardhineni"},"body":"### 📝 Background\n\nThis bounty is for bringing up the **AudioX** model using TTNN APIs on Tenstorrent hardware (Wormhole or Blackhole).\n\nAudioX is a unified framework for anything-to-audio generation from HKUST, supporting multimodal control signals. Released in 2025, key features include:\n\n* **Anything-to-audio**: Supports text, video, image, and audio inputs for audio generation\n* **Multiple tasks**: Text-to-audio, text-to-music, video-to-audio, video-to-music, audio inpainting, music completion\n* **Multimodal Adaptive Fusion**: Novel module for effective fusion of diverse multimodal inputs\n* **Large-scale training**: IF-caps dataset with 7 million high-quality samples\n* **State-of-the-art performance**: Superior results on AudioCaps, MusicCaps, T2A-bench, and AudioTime benchmarks\n* **Diffusion Transformer**: Uses diffusion-based generation with transformer architecture\n* **Instruction following**: Handles complex temporal instructions (timestamps, ordering, counting)\n* **High quality**: 16 kHz audio output with natural sound quality\n\nAudioX achieves superior performance across benchmarks, especially in text-to-audio and text-to-music generation, demonstrating powerful multimodal control and instruction-following capabilities.\n\nThe goal is to enable this model to run on Tenstorrent hardware for high-throughput, low-latency multimodal audio generation .\n\n### 🎯 What Success Looks Like\n\nA successful submission will fulfill all requirements in the following stages. Payout is made after all three stages are completed.\n\n\n### Stage 1 — Bring-Up\n\n* Implement AudioX using TTNN APIs (Python)\n* Implements the full generation pipeline:\n  * Multimodal encoders (text, video, image, audio)\n  * Multimodal Adaptive Fusion module\n  * Diffusion Transformer decoder\n  * Vocoder for waveform generation\n* Model runs on either N150 or N300 Tenstorrent hardware with no errors\n* Supports multiple generation modes:\n  * **Text-to-audio**: Generate sound effects from text descriptions\n  * **Text-to-music**: Generate music from text prompts\n  * **Video-to-audio**: Generate audio synchronized with video\n  * **Video-to-music**: Generate background music for video\n* Produces valid 16 kHz audio output on sample inputs\n* Output is verifiable (audio quality assessment, compare with PyTorch reference)\n* Achieves baseline throughput target:\n  * At least 20 tokens/second for diffusion sampling\n  * Generation time < 30 seconds for 10-second audio\n* Accuracy evaluation:\n  * Inception Score comparable to paper results\n  * Text-audio alignment score > 0.7\n  * Token-level accuracy > 95% against PyTorch reference\n* Audio quality: Natural sound quality and accurate multimodal alignment\n* Clear instructions for setup and running the model\n\n### Stage 2 — Basic Optimizations\n\n* Use optimal sharded/interleaved memory configs for transformer layers\n* Implement efficient sharding strategy for:\n  * Text encoder (CLAP or similar)\n  * Video encoder (if applicable)\n  * Multimodal Adaptive Fusion module\n  * Diffusion Transformer layers\n  * Attention mechanisms (self and cross-attention)\n* Fuse simple ops where possible (e.g., layer normalization, attention patterns, activation functions)\n* Store intermediate activations in L1 where beneficial\n* Use recommended TTNN/tt-metal diffusion model flows\n* Leverage TT library of fused ops for attention and MLP blocks\n* Optimize multimodal fusion operations\n* Efficient diffusion sampling (DDPM/DDIM)\n* Optimize vocoder integration\n\n### Stage 3 — Deeper Optimization\n\n* Maximize core counts used per inference\n* Implement deeper TT-specific optimizations:\n  * Efficient diffusion sampling with fewer steps (DDIM, DPM-Solver)\n  * Flash Attention or equivalent for attention layers\n  * Minimize generation latency\n  * Batch processing for multiple audio generations\n  * Pipeline multimodal encoding with diffusion sampling\n  * Optimize cross-modal attention\n  * Efficient temporal instruction handling\n* Minimize memory and TM (tensor manipulation) overheads\n* Explore classifier-free guidance optimization\n* Document any advanced tuning, known limitations, or trade-offs\n* Target stretched goals:\n  * 50+ tokens/second diffusion sampling\n  * Generation time < 10 seconds for 10-second audio\n  * Support for longer audio (30+ seconds)\n  * Efficient multi-task switching\n\n### 🧭 Guidance & Starting Points\n\n* Use the [TTNN model bring-up tech report](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/blob/main/tech_reports/ttnn/TTNN-model-bringup.md) as your primary reference\n* Reference [diffusion model implementations in tt-metal](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/tree/main/models/experimental/stable_diffusion) for diffusion patterns\n* Reference [transformer implementations in tt-metal](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/tree/main/models/demos/wormhole) for transformer patterns\n* Use the [AudioX project page](https://zeyuet.github.io/AudioX/) for demos and examples\n* Refer to the [AudioX paper (arXiv:2503.10522)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.10522) for technical details\n* Check [AudioX HuggingFace](https://huggingface.co/AudioX) for model checkpoints\n* Check [AudioX GitHub](https://github.com/AudioX) for official code repository\n* Refer to [TT Fused ops PR #29236](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/pull/29236) for optimization opportunities\n* The model architecture consists of:\n  * **Multimodal encoders**: Separate encoders for text, video, image, audio inputs\n  * **Multimodal Adaptive Fusion**: Fuses diverse modalities with cross-modal alignment\n  * **Diffusion Transformer**: Denoising network for audio generation\n  * **Vocoder**: Converts latent representations to waveforms\n  * **Classifier-free guidance**: For controllable generation\n* Key challenges:\n  * Multimodal fusion optimization\n  * Diffusion sampling efficiency (multiple denoising steps)\n  * Cross-modal attention across different input types\n  * Temporal instruction handling (timestamps, ordering, counting)\n  * Vocoder integration\n  * Long audio generation\n* Ask for help or file issues if ops are missing in TTNN\n\n### 🔎 Possible Approaches\n\n* Start from the official AudioX implementation and port components sequentially:\n  1. Text encoder (CLAP or similar)\n  2. Video/image encoders (if using video-to-audio)\n  3. Multimodal Adaptive Fusion module\n  4. Diffusion Transformer (U-Net or DiT architecture)\n  5. Vocoder integration\n  6. Diffusion sampling loop (DDPM/DDIM)\n  7. Classifier-free guidance\n* Validate each submodule's output against PyTorch reference before integration\n* Experiment with different sharding strategies:\n  * Attention head sharding\n  * Sequence length sharding\n  * Batch dimension sharding for diffusion steps\n* Use TTNN profiling tools to identify bottlenecks in:\n  * Multimodal encoding time\n  * Fusion module overhead\n  * Diffusion sampling iterations\n  * Cross-modal attention\n  * Vocoder latency\n* Test diverse use cases:\n  * Text-to-audio with complex descriptions\n  * Text-to-music with style instructions\n  * Video-to-audio synchronization\n  * Temporal instructions (timestamps, ordering)\n  * Audio inpainting and music completion\n* Open a draft PR early to get feedback on your approach\n\n\n\n## 📊 Result Submission Guidelines\n\nBeyond the model implementation itself, contributors must submit the following material as proof of work.\n\nHowever, feel free to open a PR at any time if you want us checking that you are on the right track.\n\nJust understand that payout is only made after **all 3 stages** are completed.\n\n**Deliverables:**\n\n* Functional model implementation in TTNN\n* Validation logs showing output correctness (latent accuracy vs PyTorch)\n* Performance report with generation time and quality metrics\n* Sample audio outputs comparing TTNN vs PyTorch:\n  * Text-to-audio examples (sound effects)\n  * Text-to-music examples (various genres)\n  * Video-to-audio examples (if implemented)\n  * Temporal instruction examples (timestamps, ordering)\n* Inception Score and other quality metrics\n* Performance header for final review\n\n**Links:**\n\n* [Performance Sheet](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/blob/main/tech_reports/ttnn/TTNN-model-bringup.md#41-performance-sheet)\n* [Perf Header Docs](https://docs.tenstorrent.com/tt-metal/latest/ttnn/ttnn/profiling_ttnn_operations.html#perf-report-headers)\n\n\n\n### 📚 Resources\n\n### Model Resources\n\n* [AudioX Project Page](https://zeyuet.github.io/AudioX/)\n* [AudioX Paper (arXiv:2503.10522)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.10522)\n* [AudioX GitHub Repository](https://github.com/AudioX) (check for actual link when available)\n* [AudioX HuggingFace Models](https://huggingface.co/AudioX) (check for actual link when available)\n* [AudioX Demo](https://huggingface.co/spaces/AudioX/demo) (check for actual link when available)\n\n### Benchmark Resources\n\n* [AudioCaps Dataset](https://audiocaps.github.io/)\n* [MusicCaps Dataset](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/googleai/musiccaps)\n* [T2A-bench Benchmark](https://github.com/WillDreamer/T2A-bench)\n* [AudioTime Benchmark](https://github.com/audiotime/audiotime)\n\n### TT-Metal Resources\n\n* [TTNN Model Bring-up Tech Report](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/blob/main/tech_reports/ttnn/TTNN-model-bringup.md)\n* [Diffusion Model Implementations in tt-metal](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/tree/main/models/experimental/stable_diffusion)\n* [Transformer Implementations in tt-metal](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/tree/main/models/demos/wormhole)\n* [TT Fused Ops PR #29236](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/pull/29236)\n* [Performance Report Header](https://docs.tenstorrent.com/tt-metal/latest/ttnn/ttnn/profiling_ttnn_operations.html#perf-report-headers)","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87b2Ru0","author":{"login":"oxlime"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi, I would like to work on this issue. @jberkowitzTT ","createdAt":"2025-12-24T02:18:58Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-3688438708","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87b4GM8","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Thanks @oxlime for the interest, the bounty is now yours! Please update this issue with your progress within 2 weeks.\n\nReview our [Bounty Terms & Conditions](https://docs.tenstorrent.com/bounty_terms.html), as these terms apply. Good luck with the project, and let us know if there are any bugs/issues on our side that are stopping you from completing the bounty. \n\nLet me know if you have any questions or if I can help!","createdAt":"2025-12-24T07:18:42Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-3688915772","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87dw3Tb","author":{"login":"oxlime"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Still working on this, have Clap completed.","createdAt":"2026-01-07T20:04:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-3720574171","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87f4ynq","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @oxlime - thank you for the update! Feel free to provide more updates as you work through it, including a PR when you have one","createdAt":"2026-01-15T18:09:58Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-3756206570","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87hDKIa","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @oxlime - wanted to check in if you're still working on this issue or if you have estimates on timelines","createdAt":"2026-01-21T01:29:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-3775701530","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87hGKQh","author":{"login":"oxlime"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @jberkowitzTT yes im still working on the issue. Have all the architecture up and working on n300. Working on optimizations. ","createdAt":"2026-01-21T06:58:49Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"HEART","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-3776488481","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87k0jV9","author":{"login":"oxlime"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Still working on this. Should be finished end of week.","createdAt":"2026-02-03T04:26:57Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-3838981501","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87nV2Zz","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @oxlime - checking in here if you have updated timelines for a PR ","createdAt":"2026-02-10T23:26:16Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-3881264755","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87n9SEo","author":{"login":"oxlime"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"PR end of day tomorrow at latest.","createdAt":"2026-02-12T15:26:01Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-3891601704","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87ojrJF","author":{"login":"bitdeckai"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I can take #32185. I will share an implementation plan and first PR draft shortly.","createdAt":"2026-02-14T10:40:50Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"SPAM","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-3901665861","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87on6dS","author":{"login":"bitdeckai"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Quick follow-up on #32185: I am still actively working on this. Please let me know if you want me to narrow scope to a smaller first PR.","createdAt":"2026-02-14T23:26:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"SPAM","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-3902777170","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87oqeDL","author":{"login":"bitdeckai"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Quick follow-up on #32185: I am still actively working on this. Please let me know if you want me to narrow scope to a smaller first PR.","createdAt":"2026-02-15T06:57:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"SPAM","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-3903447243","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87oty4A","author":{"login":"bitdeckai"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I am taking bounty #32185 and will open an implementation PR with validation details.","createdAt":"2026-02-15T12:08:10Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"SPAM","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-3904318976","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87pxZPi","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @oxlime - do you expect to have a PR by the end of this week? Otherwise, we'll look to reopen this bounty\n\nThank you for your efforts, and we're looking forward to seeing your great work for this bounty!","createdAt":"2026-02-18T17:09:36Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-3922039778","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87qj5qi","author":{"login":"brymut"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Hi @jberkowitzTT, happy to put my name up for this. My current model bring up (second so far) is awaiting review and happy to start looking into this. ","createdAt":"2026-02-20T14:38:17Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-3935279778","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87qlje3","author":{"login":"pollachisaravanan"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @jberkowitzTT \nNo disrespect to the assigned person, if the bounty is reopened, I am interested to work on it","createdAt":"2026-02-20T15:53:24Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-3935713207","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87qv9eH","author":{"login":"RustamKazmi"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Hi , can i take on this ?","createdAt":"2026-02-21T08:20:03Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-3938441095","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87rOnDP","author":{"login":"oxlime"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@jberkowitzTT Sorry, ran into some issues will get it submitted by tomorrow morning. ","createdAt":"2026-02-23T18:16:56Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-3946475727","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87rPNSu","author":{"login":"pollachisaravanan"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"> Hi [@jberkowitzTT](https://github.com/jberkowitzTT) No disrespect to the assigned person, if the bounty is reopened, I am interested to work on it\n\nI am interested to work on this bounty. Can you please assign it to me?\n","createdAt":"2026-02-23T18:47:43Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-3946632366","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87roLix","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Thanks @pollachisaravanan for the interest, the bounty is now yours! Please update this issue with your progress within 2 weeks. You will have 3 months maximum to complete this bounty, after which it will be reopened.\n\nReview our [Bounty Terms & Conditions](https://docs.tenstorrent.com/bounty_terms.html), as these terms apply. Good luck with the project, and let us know if there are any bugs/issues on our side that are stopping you from completing the bounty. \n\nIf you need access to Tenstorrent hardware, we can provide that for you through the cloud. Please comment asking for access once you've been assigned to the bounty if you need access.\n\nLet me know if you have any other questions or if we can help!","createdAt":"2026-02-24T16:08:30Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-3953178801","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87wdNZn","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@pollachisaravanan - any updates on this or thoughts on when a PR should be ready for review?","createdAt":"2026-03-10T20:18:45Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4034188903","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc870wJPk","author":{"login":"rekudyu"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"@jberkowitzTT I would lilke to work on this since there are no updates for over a month.","createdAt":"2026-03-22T13:28:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4106261476","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc870wg9A","author":{"login":"pollachisaravanan"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@rekudyu Due to some health issue I was was unable to continue on past week  and but resumed the work and currently working on it now. Already informed to @jberkowitzTT  in discord and forgot to post it here","createdAt":"2026-03-22T14:34:50Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"HEART","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4106358592","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc870wlL2","author":{"login":"rekudyu"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"okay","createdAt":"2026-03-22T14:44:05Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4106375926","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc872lLR6","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @pollachisaravanan - wanted to check in to see how it's going. Have you been able to make any progress on this?","createdAt":"2026-03-26T17:45:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4136940666","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc872tKxe","author":{"login":"eziwenk"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @jberkowitzTT, I can take this bounty if it's reopen again. Thanks.","createdAt":"2026-03-26T23:40:36Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4139035742","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc873uxjT","author":{"login":"brymut"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Ready to pick up a new model bring up, Interested in taking this on @jberkowitzTT ","createdAt":"2026-03-30T16:09:54Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4156233939","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc874wOQP","author":{"login":"brymut"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"How's this one looking @jberkowitzTT? Excited to get it going again.","createdAt":"2026-04-01T22:41:44Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4173390863","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc874wXXs","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi all! Working with the current assignee to determine if they're still working on it. If not, I'll reassign, but until then feel free to message me on Discord with any questions or thoughts.\n\nThanks!","createdAt":"2026-04-01T22:52:35Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4173428204","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc874z8N6","author":{"login":"pollachisaravanan"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @brymut @jberkowitzTT \nI am actively working on this bounty. The audiox model has multiples modules,  so it is taking little bit time to convert each module to TTNN\n","createdAt":"2026-04-02T03:20:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"HEART","users":{"totalCount":2}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4174365562","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc8741l3b","author":{"login":"willkhinz"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Working on this. I am working on a fix for this and will open a PR shortly.","createdAt":"2026-04-02T05:40:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4174798299","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc875Krxf","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@willkhinz - please do not create PRs on bounties that are assigned, especially those being actively worked on ","createdAt":"2026-04-02T20:32:15Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4180327519","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc8768I13","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @pollachisaravanan - please ensure that this bounty is completed by May 24th, and if possible please provide a PR within the next 2 weeks.\n\nLet me know how I can help you as you work on this!","createdAt":"2026-04-08T22:20:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4210068855","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc877PaoR","author":{"login":"pollachisaravanan"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"will soon open PR with next 2 weeks","createdAt":"2026-04-09T14:42:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4215122449","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc878L6TP","author":{"login":"lunchfang"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"👋 Hi there!\n\nI'm interested in working on this task. Before I start, I'd like to confirm a few details:\n\n1. **Bounty Amount**: Is the bounty still $1500?\n2. **Acceptance Criteria**: What exactly needs to be delivered? Any specific requirements?\n3. **Timeline**: Any deadline or preferred completion time?\n4. **Testing**: Are there specific test cases or environments I should use?\n5. **Payment**: What's the preferred payment method once completed?\n\nPlease confirm and I'll get started right away! 🚀\n\n---\n*Automated message from Atlas Bounty Hunter*","createdAt":"2026-04-12T07:18:03Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"SPAM","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4230980815","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc878L6n1","author":{"login":"lunchfang"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"👋 Hi!\n\nI'm interested in working on this task. Before I start, I'd like to confirm a few details:\n\n1. **Bounty Amount**: Is the bounty still $1500?\n2. **Acceptance Criteria**: What exactly needs to be delivered?\n3. **Timeline**: Any deadline?\n4. **Testing**: Any specific test cases?\n5. **Payment**: Preferred payment method?\n\nPlease confirm and I'll get started! 🚀\n\n---\n*Automated from Bounty Engineering Team*","createdAt":"2026-04-12T07:19:11Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"SPAM","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4230982133","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc878mDnH","author":{"login":"0x-aut"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Soooo","createdAt":"2026-04-13T16:02:03Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4237834695","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc879kk9e","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @pollachisaravanan - if the PR is not available by next week, we'll have to look to reopen this bounty. Please note that you will still be eligible for future bounties!","createdAt":"2026-04-15T17:44:59Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4254224222","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc879k-e_","author":{"login":"sreeshanth-soma"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @jberkowitzTT,\nIf bounty is reopened next week, please assign it to me.","createdAt":"2026-04-15T18:01:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4254328767","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87-BuqJ","author":{"login":"pollachisaravanan"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @jberkowitzTT \nCurrently I am unable to continue the audiox bringup due to health not recovered fully, could you please reassign to other person?","createdAt":"2026-04-16T16:51:13Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"HEART","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4261866121","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87-B3Ew","author":{"login":"k1shna"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @jberkowitzTT I would like to work on this. Thanks!\nGet well soon @pollachisaravanan!","createdAt":"2026-04-16T16:55:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"HEART","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4261900592","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87-EzOK","author":{"login":"RustamKazmi"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Hi @jberkowitzTT !! I'm still very interested in it.","createdAt":"2026-04-16T18:59:29Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4262671242","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87-GZcc","author":{"login":"sreeshanth-soma"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"> Hi [@jberkowitzTT](https://github.com/jberkowitzTT), If bounty is reopened next week, please assign it to me.\n\nHi @jberkowitzTT pls assign me I am very much interested in doing this.","createdAt":"2026-04-16T20:11:48Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4263089948","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87-HWAt","author":{"login":"ajumpa"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@jberkowitzTT just finished the CLIP ViT bounty, I’d like a go at a medium difficulty bounty if you reassign this!","createdAt":"2026-04-16T20:52:36Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4263338029","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87-IJTn","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Thanks @k1shna for the interest, the bounty is now yours! Please update this issue with your progress within 2 weeks. You will have 3 months maximum to complete this bounty, after which it will be reopened.\n\nReview our [Bounty Terms & Conditions](https://docs.tenstorrent.com/bounty_terms.html), as these terms apply. Good luck with the project, and let us know if there are any bugs/issues on our side that are stopping you from completing the bounty. \n\nIf you need access to Tenstorrent hardware, we can provide that for you through the cloud. Please comment asking for access once you've been assigned to the bounty if you need access.\n\nLet me know if you have any other questions or if we can help!\n\n\n\nThank you everyone for the great interest in this bounty! We're looking to be as fair as possible by limiting to granting to the first person without a bounty assigned to them. I'm looking to get all of the bounties that are currently ready for review fully reviewed soon. I greatly appreciate everyone's hard work & understanding through the process.","createdAt":"2026-04-16T21:33:09Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"HEART","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4263548135","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87-NrfL","author":{"login":"k1shna"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Thanks for assigning. I've started working on this!","createdAt":"2026-04-17T03:07:21Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4264998859","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABAjyiZw","author":{"login":"k1shna"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@jberkowitzTT quick update on this - I've opened a draft PR: [#43226](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/pull/43226)\n\nCurrently landed:\n- Directory scaffolding under `models/experimental/audiox/`\n- Multimodal Adaptive Fusion (MAF) block (PyTorch reference + TTNN port + PCC test)\n\nNext, I'll be working through the remaining components.\nAlso, could I get cloud access to Tenstorrent hardware? I've sent an email with more details.\nThanks!","createdAt":"2026-04-28T05:07:22Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4332495463","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABAoHFgw","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Sure! @k1shna - just responded with a code for cloud access!","createdAt":"2026-04-28T16:07:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"HEART","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4337026435","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABCX7GcA","author":{"login":"zp6"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #32185\n\nI would like to work on this bounty.\n\nGitHub: @zp6","createdAt":"2026-05-14T20:00:52Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"SPAM","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4454270576","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABHdGsSg","author":{"login":"velonica0"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"I would like to work on this, if it is reopened.\nI see that the deadline for the task is June 24th.","createdAt":"2026-06-25T02:17:39Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4795247690","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABHlaZLg","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @velonica0 - thank you for your interest, and apologies for the confusion as the due date is actually July 16th since this was assigned to the current assignee on April 16th\n\nAs always, feel free to email me with any bounty ideas you have that aren't currently being worked on ","createdAt":"2026-06-25T20:40:03Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"HEART","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185#issuecomment-4803959086","viewerDidAuthor":false}],"createdAt":"2025-11-10T17:57:18Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAAB2MNMtg","name":"bounty","description":"","color":"aaaaaa"},{"id":"LA_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAAB2MQ32A","name":"bounty_difficulty/medium","description":"Medium Bounty","color":"EE8199"},{"id":"LA_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAACNAiXkw","name":"model bringup","description":"For model initialization or bring-up stage bounties","color":"fa8c2b"}],"state":"OPEN","title":"[Bounty $1500] AudioX bring up using TTNN APIs","updatedAt":"2026-06-25T20:40:03Z","url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32185"}
